The C++ Unigram Viterbi implementation follows the optimized Unigram algorithm
in Hugging Face tokenizers 0.22.2:
https://github.com/huggingface/tokenizers/tree/v0.22.2/tokenizers/src/models/unigram

The upstream implementation is licensed under Apache License 2.0; see
LICENSE.tokenizers. This C++ adaptation replaces the Rust implementation and
supports the Unigram/Metaspace profile used by the exported Pocket TTS models.

Unicode casing/character-property tables are generated by
scripts/generate_tokenizer_unicode.py from Python 3.12 / Unicode 15.0.0.
